PrefixSum: array, any subarray that starts at beginning of array 

sum of that first x values...
    - prefix product can also happen
    - Postfix == opposite of prefix 

Example problem: Q: given an array of values, desgin a data strcuture that can query the sum of a subarray of the values. 
    - function = querySum(L, R)  O(n) if hard code
    - more efficient method == prefix sum - prefix value = sum of the subarray. 
        - since its in 1 swoop = O(1) operation. 

Code:

    def _init_(self,nums):
        self.prefix = []
        total = 0
        for n in nums:
            total += n
            self.prefix.append(total)

    def rangeSum(self, left, right):
        preRight = self.prefix[right]
        preLeft = self.prefix[left - 1] if left > 0 else 0
        return (preRight - preLeft)

